// AWS CloudTrail Trail Reconfigured  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1562.008
// Detects modification of a CloudTrail trail (UpdateTrail), e.g. disabling multi-region logging, global service events, or log file…
// False positives: Legitimate trail configuration changes (review the new settings).
// Source: rules/defense-evasion/cloudtrail-update-trail.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName =~ "UpdateTrail" and eventSource =~ "cloudtrail.amazonaws.com"
